/E (The initial dataset contained many service text and duplicate variables that had no modeling value or duplicated information about the accident location. To eliminate redundant attributes, a node Column Filter was applied to remove identifiers \(ID and Source\), address fields \(Street, City, Country, Zipcode\), duplicate coordinates \(End_Lat and End_Lng\), and other text descriptions of accidents. This step reduced the size of the dataset and allowed us to focus on variables relevant to predicting accident severity.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
