/E (To better account for temporal patterns of road activity, additional binary features were generated using the Rule Engine node. The Rush_Hour variable takes the value 1 during morning \(7-9\) and evening \(16-18\) peak intervals, reflecting increased traffic load. The Weekend variable denotes Saturday and Sunday. Both variables contribute to more accurate modeling of the impact of daily and weekly cycles on the probability of serious traffic accidents.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
