/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Scorer calculates the main classification metrics by comparing the actual Severity_bin values with the model predictions. It generates a confusion matrix and accuracy, sensitivity, specificity, and precision metrics, which are then used to summarize the results. The parameters are the same in all three models, which ensures a correct comparison between specifications. The consistent output format makes it easy to integrate metrics into subsequent nodes \(Math Formula and Concatenate\). Scorer does not change the data, but only evaluates the quality of the predictions.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
