776 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To improve model performance, a Hyperparameter Optimization Loop was used, which iterates through combinations of Gradient Boosting parameters within specified ranges. The cycle changed ntrees \(30-70\), maxdepth \(6-15\), and learnrate \(0.05-0.2\), and the quality of each model was evaluated using the minimized Cohen's kappa indicator. The results of the search showed that the optimal parameters were: ntrees = 70, maxdepth = 15, learnrate = 0.15, which provided the best objective function value \(0.858\). These parameters were used to build the final model.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [1]
>>
